      "text": "learn of me, and you shall have peace in me, D&C 19:23 (58:1). learn to impart one to another as gospel requires, D&C 88:123. study, learn, and become acquainted with good books, languages, D&C 90:15. the Lord’s people must be chastened until they learn obedience, D&C 105:6. let every man learn his duty, D&C 107:99. men’s hearts are set so much on things of world that they do not learn this one lesson, D&C 121:35, 39. we have learned by sad experience, D&C 121:39. let him who is ignorant learn wisdom, D&C 136:32.",
